e:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. </span><span style="color:#231f20;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" id="f-24">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="height:42.75pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:42.75pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:72pt;text-indent:-72pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 5.02&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Departure of Directors or Certain Officers; Election of Directors; Appointment of Certain Officers; Compensatory Arrangements of Certain Officers.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">(c)</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On September 4, 2026, Zions Bancorporation, N.A. (the &#8220;Bank&#8221;) announced that Brian Stringham, 51, will succeed Jason Arbuckle as Senior Vice President and Corporate Controller of the Bank, effective September 7, 2026. In this role, Mr. Stringham will serve as the Bank's principal accounting officer. Mr. Arbuckle will assume the role of Senior Director of Corporate Finance and Transformation.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Mr. Stringham joined the Bank in 2003 and served as Assistant Corporate Controller and Director of External Financial Reporting since 2020, overseeing the Bank's U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission and regulatory reporting processes. Prior to assuming that role, he was responsible for the accounting and reporting of the Bank's credit and lending activities.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">There are no family relationships between Mr. Stringham and any director or other executive officer of the Bank, nor any arrangement or understanding between him and any other person pursuant to which he was selected as an officer. There are no transactions involving Mr. Stringham that would require disclosure under Item 404(a) of Regulation S-K. Mr. Stringham will participate in the Bank's compensation and benefit plans generally available to similarly situated executive officers. Information about the Bank's executive compensation, incentive plans, and benefits can be found in the Bank's 2026 Proxy Statement.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 9.01&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Financial Statements and Exhibits</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">.</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">(d) Exhibits</span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following exhibits are furnished as part of this Current Report on Form 8-K:</span></div><div style="margin-top:5pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:97.807%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.868%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:89.932%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Exhibit Number</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Description</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">101</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Cover Page Interactive Data File - the cover page XBRL tags are embedded within the Inline XBRL document.</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;li